B6  TRANSLATION TO KM1'S KHRONON PARAMETER (conditional on KM1's model) AND G7
==============================================================================================================
  KM1 (C7): a0 -> a0 (1 + D/3), D = 2 w^2/(eps c^2)  =>  beta = 2 w_ref^2/(3 eps c^2) = 2.6704e-06/eps
  KM1's window c14 in [1e-5, 2.5e-5] (eps = c2 = c14/(1 - 2 c14)) predicts beta in [0.107, 0.267]; G7's line beta = 0.10 is eps = 2.67e-05
  SPARC's beta_95 = 1.80  =>  eps >= 1.48e-06 (c14 >= 1.48e-06) at 95%, conditional on KM1's model, the sphere average D/3, and W1 (independent velocity components)
